{"id":18399,"date":"2023-11-20T13:59:32","date_gmt":"2023-11-20T20:59:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?post_type=resources&#038;p=18399"},"modified":"2024-01-16T16:27:10","modified_gmt":"2024-01-16T23:27:10","slug":"solopreneur-venture-into-health-fitness","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/solopreneur-venture-into-health-fitness\/","title":{"rendered":"A &#8220;Solopreneur&#8221; Venture into Health and Fitness"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"18399\" class=\"elementor elementor-18399\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-0318c0b elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"0318c0b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-bb92480\" data-id=\"bb92480\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed3c32a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed3c32a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><iframe style=\"border-radius: 12px;\" src=\"https:\/\/open.spotify.com\/embed\/episode\/1dnaoht8Ltzgr58Cp6Pf7C?utm_source=generator&amp;theme=0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"152\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/p><h2>About this Episode<\/h2><p>For Dr. Nick Green, BehaviorFit started as a dream and a blog. Today it has grown to provide behavioral consulting, 1:1 coaching, and continuing education courses focusing on the use of behavior science to improve health and fitness. Dr. Green joins ABA After Hours to discuss how his passions drove his \u201csolopreneur\u201d venture and what success as a business owner means to him.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/behaviorfit.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Find out more about BehaviorFit<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>If you\u2019re interested in the CE courses discussed during this podcast, you can access them using the links below.<\/p><ul><li><a href=\"https:\/\/behaviorfit.com\/product\/intervention-101-information-and-ethics-for-health-and-fitness\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Intervention 101: Information &amp; Ethics for Health &amp; Fitness<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/behaviorfit.com\/academy\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">All BehaviorFit courses<\/a><\/li><\/ul><h2>About the Guest Speaker<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-f2581bd authorSection elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"f2581bd\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b586236\" data-id=\"b586236\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90e85da elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"90e85da\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/nick-green-phd-bcba-product-owner-data-analytics-rethinkbh.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-18057\" alt=\"Headshot of Nick Green\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/nick-green-phd-bcba-product-owner-data-analytics-rethinkbh.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/nick-green-phd-bcba-product-owner-data-analytics-rethinkbh-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/nick-green-phd-bcba-product-owner-data-analytics-rethinkbh-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-959d6d6\" data-id=\"959d6d6\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0283cc0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0283cc0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Nick Green, Ph.D., BCBA<\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Product Owner &#8211; Data Analytics, RethinkBH<\/span><\/p><p>Dr. Nick Green oversees the development of analytics tools for behavioral health customers. He leads and creates innovative solutions for clinical data-based decision-making.<\/p><p>Dr. Green began working in the field of applied behavior analysis (ABA) in 2009 and later earned an MS in <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/leveraging-organizational-behavior-management-enhance-practice-observation-measurement-indicators-success\/\">Organizational Behavior Management<\/a> (OBM) and a PhD in Behavior Analysis from the University of Florida. His expertise and research focused on reducing sedentary behavior (sitting) in the workplace. Dr. Green is a peer-reviewed author and featured presenter at annual ABA conferences. Nick\u2019s passion lies in workplace wellness and data analysis \u2013 he wants to create the best tools for clinicians to have a better workday.<\/p><p>Outside of everyday analytics work, Dr. Green helps others get healthier and fit. As a PhD student, he founded his own behavior analytic consulting firm,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/behaviorfit.com\/about\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BehaviorFit<\/a>. Here, he provides expert coaching and other educational resources to help others achieve their health and fitness goals. He loves functional fitness, taking midday walks with his blue-tick heeler\/cattle dog (Pete) and wrestling with his son Ogden.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":18417,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"A \u201cSolopreneur\u201d Venture into Health &amp; Fitness - Podcast Ep.","_seopress_titles_desc":"On this episode of ABA After Hours we talk with Dr. Nick Green about his solopreneur journey with where behavior science meets health and fitness success.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[351],"resource-topic":[327,329,69],"resource-tag":[287,343,339],"class_list":["post-18399","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-podcast","resource-topic-aba","resource-topic-behavior","resource-topic-business","resource-tag-continuing-education","resource-tag-education","resource-tag-success"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/18399","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/18399\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/18417"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=18399"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"audience","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/audience?post=18399"},{"taxonomy":"resource-type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-type?post=18399"},{"taxonomy":"resource-topic","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-topic?post=18399"},{"taxonomy":"resource-tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resource-tag?post=18399"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}